=\"tag\">macOS</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 23, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/command-a\" target=\"_blank\">Command A+</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Cohere's open-source enterprise workhorse model released under Apache 2.0 license as a 218B sparse model for enterprise AI applications.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">model</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Cohere</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 23, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/forsy\" target=\"_blank\">Forsy</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Platform that enables users to capture and monetize their AI agent workflow data, part of the growing ecosystem around AI agents and their operational data.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">data</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">monetization</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"source\">Product Hunt • May 23, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates section\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">Product Updates</div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <